{"pageProps":{"meta":{"id":"obsidian:free-api-agnes-image-20261102","title":"Agnes免费绘图API实测：15.7秒生成这张图，接法和条件说清楚","date":"2026-11-03","updated":"2026-11-03","summary":"机器人浇水原图、接口参数与阶段免费条件。","categories":[{"id":"markdown-category-0-资源分享","name":"资源分享","color":"default"}],"categoryNames":["资源分享"],"tags":[{"id":"markdown-tag-0-免费API","name":"免费API","color":"default"}],"image":"/obsidian-assets/free-api-agnes-image-20261102/cover-5c1bc56842.jpg","coverBlockId":null,"slug":"free-api-agnes-image-20261102","legacyPaths":[],"lang":"zh-CN","translationOf":null,"articleType":"article","discoveryName":"Agnes免费绘图API实测：15.7秒生成这张图，接法和条件说清楚","discoveryCategory":null,"discoveryStage":null,"discoveryUrl":null,"source":"markdown","fixedProductFooter":true},"markdownHtml":"<blockquote>\n<p><strong>摘要</strong>\n先看真实出图，再看默认试用档的免费条件\n黑粉科技 · 2026年11月2日资料与实测</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>想把生图接进自己的工具，最有用的东西就是一张真正由接口返回的图。我给Agnes Image 2.5 Flash发了一条“机器人给幼苗浇水”的任务，图片收全用了15.688秒。先看原图。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/free-api-agnes-image-20261102/image-agnes-result-c3704bc78f.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/d421636da7b03003b3181e81-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/d421636da7b03003b3181e81-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/free-api-agnes-image-20261102/image-agnes-result-c3704bc78f.png\" alt=\"实测生成原图\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1312\" height=\"736\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>画面里有机器人、手持水壶、幼苗和水流，主要对象与动作都对上了。这次请求选的是agnes-image-2.5-flash，要求1K、16∶9、一次一张；收到的原文件是1312×736的PNG，没有放大成所谓4K样片。</p>\n<h2>免费给谁用，这一句先说清</h2>\n<p>11月2日采集的官网定价页，把这款图片模型的体验价列为零。**这是默认用户试用档的阶段优惠。**同页说明：Agent Plan按刊例价折算积分，不参加这项限免。已经买了套餐，也不能直接照着“零价”三个字理解自己的计费。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/free-api-agnes-image-20261102/image-agnes-conditions-dcff4dc1de.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/f18bece3c375ed02a01f20d3-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/f18bece3c375ed02a01f20d3-769.webp 769w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/free-api-agnes-image-20261102/image-agnes-conditions-dcff4dc1de.png\" alt=\"官网试用计费条件\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"769\" height=\"394\"></picture></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/free-api-agnes-image-20261102/image-agnes-image-price-05b174a8ef.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/5f7244d0b2c3419e31618f81-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/5f7244d0b2c3419e31618f81-769.webp 769w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/free-api-agnes-image-20261102/image-agnes-image-price-05b174a8ef.png\" alt=\"图片型号定价\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"769\" height=\"414\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>本次提交前，程序检查了对应型号的官方即时价格，确认零价才发出请求，也没有在失败时切到收费型号。最终账户账单还没有读取，所以我展示的是当前政策和实际产物，不把它写成已核销的零元账单。</p>\n<p>入口从<a href=\"https://agnes-ai.com/\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://agnes-ai.com/\">Agnes官网</a>进入，自己创建账户和密钥；再打开<a href=\"https://wiki.agnes-ai.com/zh-Hans/docs/agnes-image-25-flash\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://wiki.agnes-ai.com/zh-Hans/docs/agnes-image-25-flash\">图片模型文档</a>。免费条件看定价页，参数看模型文档，两处各管一件事。</p>\n<h2>接口怎么接，参数怎样填</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/free-api-agnes-image-20261102/image-agnes-docs-055085b210.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/3cb5445e275afe531f79502c-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/3cb5445e275afe531f79502c-769.webp 769w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/free-api-agnes-image-20261102/image-agnes-docs-055085b210.png\" alt=\"官方模型文档\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"769\" height=\"914\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>文生图使用POST /v1/images/generations。接口地址是<a href=\"https://apihub.agnes-ai.com/v1/images/generations\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://apihub.agnes-ai.com/v1/images/generations\">https://apihub.agnes-ai.com/v1/images/generations</a>。下面是本轮实际使用的请求体。直连时按官网配置自己的密钥；本轮经黑粉盒子转发，没有额外重复执行直连请求。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-JSON\">{\n  &quot;model&quot;: &quot;agnes-image-2.5-flash&quot;,\n  &quot;prompt&quot;: &quot;白色摄影棚里，一台青绿色的小机器人拿着浇水壶，正在给一盆绿色幼苗浇水。完整展示机器人、浇水壶和花盆，水流清楚可见，柔和自然光，没有人物，没有文字。&quot;,\n  &quot;size&quot;: &quot;1K&quot;,\n  &quot;ratio&quot;: &quot;16:9&quot;,\n  &quot;n&quot;: 1\n}\n</code></pre>\n<p>size是输出档位，ratio是画幅。像点餐时先选大杯小杯，再选冷饮热饮，这两个选项合在一起才确定你要的规格。1K不是“精确宽度1000像素”；本次1312×736就说明，最后还得查看原文件尺寸。</p>\n<p>文档也支持图生图、多图合成和更高分辨率。它们和这一张文生图属于不同操作，本篇没有拿文生图结果替它们做效果保证。需要参考图时，按文档把图片放进extra_body.image；私有原图不要为了一个公开链接随手传到图床。</p>\n<h2>这张图够不够用，怎样验收</h2>\n<p>我会先看任务里的名词和动词，再看画面细节：机器人是否真的拿着壶，水是否流向幼苗，手、壶柄和水流有没有穿插错误。只检查“下载到一张图片”，会漏掉真正影响使用的部分。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>本次项目</th>\n<th>实际记录</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>请求型号</td>\n<td>agnes-image-2.5-flash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>输出档位／画幅</td>\n<td>1K／16:9</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>原文件</td>\n<td>PNG，1312×736</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>完整上游耗时</td>\n<td>15.688秒，不含本机排队</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>执行型号回报</td>\n<td>服务未返回该字段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>次数</td>\n<td>1次文生图，未做批量稳定性测试</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>另一个免密绘图入口Pollinations，我也发了机器人浇水的任务。它返回了图片，但主体变成了人物。这张失败图会在免费绘图目录篇保留：接口回200和任务做对，是两层验收。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>引用：我的判断</strong>\n想给个人工具补一个文生图入口，可以先用这组参数跑一张自己的任务。默认试用档的阶段零价是吸引力；套餐差异、实际尺寸和任务遵循，是决定你能不能接着用的三件事。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>主要查证来源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://wiki.agnes-ai.com/zh-Hans/docs/agnes-image-25-flash\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://wiki.agnes-ai.com/zh-Hans/docs/agnes-image-25-flash\">Agnes Image 2.5 Flash 官方文档</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://wiki.agnes-ai.com/zh-Hans/docs/pricing\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://wiki.agnes-ai.com/zh-Hans/docs/pricing\">Agnes 官方定价与试用计费</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://agnes-ai.com/\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://agnes-ai.com/\">Agnes 官网</a></li>\n</ul>\n","relatedPosts":[{"id":"obsidian:free-api-image-directory-20261102","rawId":"obsidian:free-api-image-directory-20261102","slug":"free-api-image-directory-20261102","legacyPaths":[],"title":"免费绘图API怎么选：免密、周期额度和新人试用资料目录","date":"2026-11-03","updated":"2026-11-03","summary":"先看实际原图，再按免费来源选绘图接口。","categories":[{"id":"markdown-category-0-资源分享","name":"资源分享","color":"default"}],"categoryNames":["资源分享"],"tags":[{"id":"markdown-tag-0-免费API","name":"免费API","color":"default"}],"pageCover":"/obsidian-assets/free-api-image-directory-20261102/cover-b1ccd2dbec.jpg","cover":"/obsidian-assets/free-api-image-directory-20261102/cover-b1ccd2dbec.jpg","source":"markdown","status":"published","lang":"zh-CN","translationOf":null,"articleType":"article","discoveryName":"免费绘图API怎么选：免密、周期额度和新人试用资料目录","discoveryCategory":null,"discoveryStage":null,"discoveryUrl":null,"sourcePath":"posts/free-api-image-directory-20261102.md","fixedProductFooter":true},{"id":"obsidian:free-api-text-trial-directory-20261102","rawId":"obsidian:free-api-text-trial-directory-20261102","slug":"free-api-text-trial-directory-20261102","legacyPaths":[],"title":"免费文字API试用额度能用多久？新人赠额和评估接口分类整理","date":"2026-11-03","updated":"2026-11-03","summary":"新人赠额、评估密钥和到期条件分类整理。","categories":[{"id":"markdown-category-0-资源分享","name":"资源分享","color":"default"}],"categoryNames":["资源分享"],"tags":[{"id":"markdown-tag